			title: "A World Worth Crossing"
			description: ["You can sprint, roll, climb, glide, grapple, ride, sail, blink, recall and, eventually, fly. None of them replaces the others: horses win on roads, boats win on rivers, a grapple wins in a dungeon, a recall wins when you are late.", "Flight is the last thing you earn and the most fenced: it should be a reward, not a skip."]
